        "calls": 1,
        "text": "The Freebuff service now actively checks that live data streams are still sending updates, closing the connection and falling back to manual checks if a stream goes silent for thirty seconds. This safeguards the experience for anyone watching an AI task run in the desktop or web interface, preventing the screen from freezing while waiting for results. Previously, if the connection stalled, the output would remain hidden for several minutes until a longer timeout expired. The new safety check ensures the service notices the silence quickly and recovers, so you see the task's progress without long, unexplained gaps.",
        "at": "2026-11-03T00:02:19.852Z",
        "src": "bccc22420cdf"
      }
